{
  "id": "NUM.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Numbers 10",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Make two silver trumpets; of hammered work you shall make them; and you shall use them for summoning the congregation, and for breaking camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when both are blown, all the congregation shall gather themselves to you at the entrance of the tent of meeting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if they blow only one, then the leaders, the heads of the tribes of Israel, shall gather themselves to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you blow an alarm, the camps that are on the east side shall set out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you blow an alarm the second time, the camps that are on the south side shall set out. An alarm is to be blown whenever they are to set out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when the assembly is to be gathered together, you shall blow, but you shall not sound an alarm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Aaron, the priests, shall blow the trumpets. The trumpets shall be to you for a perpetual statute throughout your generations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you go to war in your land against the adversary who oppresses you, then you shall sound an alarm with the trumpets, that you may be remembered before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, and you shall be saved from your enemies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the day of your gladness also, and at your appointed feasts, and at the beginnings of your months, you shall blow the trumpets over your burnt offerings and over the sacrifices of your peace offerings; they shall serve you for remembrance before your God: I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the second year, in the second month, on the twentieth day of the month, the cloud was taken up from over the tabernacle of the testimony, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the people of Israel set out by stages from the wilderness of Sinai; and the cloud settled down in the wilderness of Paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They set out for the first time at the command of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " by Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The standard of the camp of the men of Judah set out first by their companies; and over their host was Nahshon the son of Amminadab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Issachar was Nethanel the son of Zuar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Zebulun was Eliab the son of Helon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the tabernacle was taken down, the sons of Gershon and the sons of Merari, who carried the tabernacle, set out. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the standard of the camp of Reuben set out by their companies; and over their host was Elizur the son of Shedeur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Simeon was Shelumi-el the son of Zurishaddai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Gad was Eliasaph the son of Deuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Kohathites set out, carrying the holy things, and the tabernacle was set up before their arrival. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the standard of the camp of the men of Ephraim set out by their companies; and over their host was Elishama the son of Ammihud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Manasseh was Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Benjamin was Abidan the son of Gideoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the standard of the camp of the men of Dan, acting as the rear guard of all the camps, set out by their companies; and over their host was Ahiezer the son of Ammishaddai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Asher was Pagiel the son of Ochran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And over the host of the tribe of the men of Naphtali was Ahira the son of Enan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This was the order of march of the people of Israel according to their hosts, when they set out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to Hobab the son of Reuel the Midianite, Moses' father-in-law, “We are setting out for the place of which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, ‘I will give it to you’; come with us, and we will do you good; for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has promised good to Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he said to him, “I will not go; I will depart to my own land and to my kindred.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, “Do not leave us, I pray you, for you know how we are to encamp in the wilderness, and you will serve as eyes for us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
